The collaboration between Masa, the Celo Foundation, and Talent Protocol marks a significant step toward mainstream adoption of Web3 identity solutions. As Celo continues to grow—boasting over 250,000 daily active users and integrations with major protocols like Uniswap, Aave, and Curve—the Prosperity Passport will play a pivotal role in scaling Talent Protocol’s vision of a decentralized professional network.

Future integrations, such as full support for .celo domain names within Celo’s wallet infrastructure and additional partnerships with Celo projects, promise to enhance the utility of the Prosperity Passport. For Talent Protocol, this means more opportunities to connect builders with resources, communities, and financial tools, fostering a Web3 ecosystem where potential truly matters.

